<title>UK: Euromoney to buy Disney publisher -  paper.</title>
<headline>Euromoney to buy Disney publisher -  paper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Business and industry magazine publisher Euromoney Publications Plc is expected to announce shortly that it is buying Institutional Investor from Walt Disney, the Guardian newspaper said.</p>
<p>Euromoney is expected to pay up to $130 million for the specialist financial publications house.</p>
<p>&quot;Institutional Investor, whose publications directed at currency and bond markets compete with Euromoney's titles, was bought by Disney as part of its $19.5 billion acquisition of Capital Cities, owner of ABC television network, in August 1995,&quot; the newspaper said.</p>
</text>
